# Copy to .env.dev.local / .env.prod.local (both gitignored) — deploy:dev / deploy:prod
# (package.json) build with `vite --mode dev` / `--mode prod`, which load the matching file
# automatically. Not secret — the OAuth Client ID is public by design — but it's
# environment-specific (DEV vs PROD Discord Application), so it isn't checked in.
# `.env.local` (no mode suffix) is still what plain `npm run dev`/`npm run build` fall back to.
VITE_CLIENT_ID=your-discord-application-client-id
